  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core Maps control is a powerful data visualization component for rendering geographical maps using GeoJSON and shape data. It supports features like multiple layers, markers, bubbles, data labels, color mapping, legend, tooltip, zooming and panning, shape selection, highlight, and navigation lines. It integrates with OpenStreetMap and Bing Maps tile layers and supports choropleth maps for displaying region-wise data distributions. Ideal for location-based analytics and geospatial dashboards in ASP.NET Core applications.",
